id: pm-5q8wa0
title: Legacy invalid provenance findings block health without a safe disposition path
description: "pm health correctly surfaces privacy-safe aggregates for immutable boolean and single-digit provenance pollution, but currently treats those historical findings as project-health failures even though they cannot be corrected without rewriting truthful history. Keep the finding and storage aggregate visible, classify it as advisory like resolver-zero-success, and prove newly generated provenance is still refused at write time."
